This folder contains:
  -the jupyter notebooks needed for the petitRadtrans tutorials 
  -the required input_data folder (containing opacities and stellar spectra)

How to setup collab-workbooks on google drive:
Copy the notebooks into your "Colab Notebooks" folder
Make a new folder BadHonnef2025/pRT/ and copy input_data_BH.zip there

On your own PC:
Copy notebooks and input_data_BH.zip on your pc
Install petitRADTRANS ( https://petitradtrans.readthedocs.io/en/latest/content/installation.html )
Set paths in the notebooks accordingly.
